{"id":"n14182-1-6","stage":4,"title":"꼴 · 形","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14182-1-6-1","ko":"그 시계는 어떻게 생겼죠?","zh":"那个手表长什么样呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그：那个。","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43883","senseId":"1","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}},{"text":"시계는","meaning":"钟，表","explanation":"시계：钟，表；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"시계","audio":"/audio/a658dc1b94077c9f96de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30190","senseId":"1","lemma":"시계","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시계는","audio":"/audio/d6fc37108aa1e46f276d.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"생겼죠?","meaning":"长","explanation":"생기다：长；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；죠：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"생기다","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67898","senseId":"4","lemma":"생기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생겼죠","audio":"/audio/b75689ed9a2ca0115f13.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"43883","definition":"指代与听话人较近或听话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"a658dc1b94077c9f","term":"시계","zh":"钟，表","audio":"/audio/a658dc1b94077c9f96de.mp3","entryId":"30190","definition":"指示时间的仪器。","pronunciation":["시계","시게"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"fc2a5a2e23bd6357","term":"생기다","zh":"长","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3","entryId":"67898","definition":"人或事物的长相成为某种样子。","pronunciation":["생기다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4f9505e8513767c96c36.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14182-1-6-2","ko":"모양은 둥근 꼴이고 하얀색으로 되어 있어요.","zh":"它是圆形的，颜色是白色的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"모양은","meaning":"样子，模样","explanation":"모양：样子，模样；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"모양","audio":"/audio/f1cd655a5837981f96d3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62397","senseId":"1","lemma":"모양","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모양은","audio":"/audio/9f082920a60e242ce7d2.mp3"}},{"text":"둥근","meaning":"圆，圆圆的","explanation":"둥글다：圆，圆圆的；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"둥글다","audio":"/audio/155ed9eaa3936402de81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"50900","senseId":"1","lemma":"둥글다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"둥근","audio":"/audio/9aa431da431313864901.mp3"}},{"text":"꼴이고","meaning":"形，形状","explanation":"꼴：形，形状；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"꼴","audio":"/audio/c0d30d4f0968afd7de2d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14182","senseId":"1","lemma":"꼴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꼴이고","audio":"/audio/e4fabb4ac7ad74b6beae.mp3"}},{"text":"하얀색으로","meaning":"白色","explanation":"하얀색：白色；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"하얀색","audio":"/audio/7eac168815ca1e773158.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83994","senseId":"1","lemma":"하얀색","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하얀색으로","audio":"/audio/fd7959c6357d9f2c577a.mp3"}},{"text":"되어","meaning":"做成，用……做","explanation":"되다：做成，用……做；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"9","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되어","audio":"/audio/50e84bc2da43dfbd09ba.mp3"}},{"text":"있어요.","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어요","audio":"/audio/499f8423f214354759ff.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f1cd655a5837981f","term":"모양","zh":"样子，模样","audio":"/audio/f1cd655a5837981f96d3.mp3","entryId":"62397","definition":"表露于外的长相或形貌。","pronunciation":["모양"]},{"id":"155ed9eaa3936402","term":"둥글다","zh":"圆，圆圆的","audio":"/audio/155ed9eaa3936402de81.mp3","entryId":"50900","definition":"与圆圈或球的样子相同或相似。","pronunciation":["둥글다"]},{"id":"c0d30d4f0968afd7","term":"꼴","zh":"形，形状","audio":"/audio/c0d30d4f0968afd7de2d.mp3","entryId":"14182","definition":"事物的样子。","pronunciation":["꼴"]},{"id":"7eac168815ca1e77","term":"하얀색","zh":"白色","audio":"/audio/7eac168815ca1e773158.mp3","entryId":"83994","definition":"像雪或牛奶一样明亮而鲜明的颜色。","pronunciation":["하얀색"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"做成，用……做","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"由某种材料或成分构成。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/ee6594b73e28a8eb5dbb.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.87,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14182","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":138,"sequenceScore":2.6967,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["它是圆形的，颜色是白色的。","那个手表长什么样呢？","你到底在看什么，笑得那么开心啊？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["那个手表长什么样呢？","你到底在看什么，笑得那么开心啊？","它是圆形的，颜色是白色的。"],"answer":2}]}
